cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "flumen: An R Workflow Manager for Distributed Bioinformatics without Centralized Storage"
abstract: "Workflow manager for distributed bioinformatics with locality-aware
  scheduling, cross-machine distribution via TCP, and multi-language tasks (R,
  Python, shell). Task outputs travel directly from worker to worker, requiring
  no centralized storage."
